  "description": "Are you ready to push yourself to the limit and get the best out of every trail? Then it's you we've developed the Wild Creed for. Get ready for the ultimate adrenaline rush! Together with the BULLS enduro pros, we have created a bike that inspires with its performance and precise handling. Innovations such as the 4-link swing arm rear suspension combined with RockShox suspension and 170/160 mm travel provide the best conditions for aggressive enduro action and maximum control on the trails. The centrepiece is the light and stiff full carbon frame, complemented by top-class Rumble components such as the Altimate Pro carbon handlebar/stem unit on the Wild Creed Team and the Escalator Pro dropper post. With this enduro MTB, you can constantly redefine your limits.",
